<title>UK: Scott Pickford says can't advise on offers.</title>
<headline>Scott Pickford says can't advise on offers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil services firm Scott Pickford Plc said on Thursday it was unable to advise shareholders on indicative offers from Australia's Aerodata Holdings Ltd and its U.S. rival, Core Laboratories NV.</p>
<p>Scott Pickford said it was awaiting the resolution of uncertainty surrounding a previously-announced share exchange with Aerodata, a geotechnical survey specialist.</p>
</text>
